OL,3,GNEWSAOpinion divided on tourist tax for
OL,4,ACornwall                               
OL,6,FRejecting the power to introduce a     
OL,7,Ftourist tax would make "no sense" the  
OL,8,Fleader of Cornwall Council has said.   
OL,10,FAt a meeting of the authority,         
OL,11,Fcouncillors voted 49-43 against a      
OL,12,Fmotion objecting to the principle of an
OL,13,Fovernight visitor levy - after         
OL,14,FConservative members argued it could   
OL,15,Fdamage the local economy and put off   
OL,16,Fvisitors.                              
OL,18,FThe ability to charge the tax could    
OL,19,Fform part of a devolution deal the     
OL,20,Fcouncil is negotiating with the        
OL,21,Fgovernment.                            
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
