OL,3,GNEWSAOpinion divided on tourist tax for
OL,4,ACornwall                               
OL,6,FCouncillor Leigh Frost said the        
OL,7,Fauthority should take up the offer and 
OL,8,Fexplore its potential impact before a  
OL,9,Fvote by all members on whether to      
OL,10,Fimplement the levy.                    
